  data: {
    LLM: "On your turn, play exactly one card from your hand by:\n1. Pairing: If your card matches a table card's rank, capture both.\n2. Combining: If your card equals the arithmetic sum of 2+ table cards, capture them all.\n3. Building: Lay your hand card with table cards, announce the intended total. Another player cannot steal the build unless they match it first.\n4. Trailing: If you can't or won't capture/build, simply lay a card face-up on the table.",
    Player: "On your turn, play exactly one card from your hand by:\n1. Pairing: If your card matches a table card's rank, capture both.\n2. Combining: If your card equals the arithmetic sum of 2+ table cards, capture them all.\n3. Building: Lay your hand card with table cards, announce the intended total. Another player cannot steal the build unless they match it first.\n4. Trailing: If you can't or won't capture/build, simply lay a card face-up on the table.",
    objective: 'Score 11 points (or 21) before opponents. Points come from special cards, counting cards, and spades.',
    gameplay: "On your turn, play exactly one card from your hand by:\n1. Pairing: If your card matches a table card's rank, capture both.\n2. Combining: If your card equals the arithmetic sum of 2+ table cards, capture them all.\n3. Building: Lay your hand card with table cards, announce the intended total. Another player cannot steal the build unless they match it first.\n4. Trailing: If you can't or won't capture/build, simply lay a card face-up on the table.",
    keyRules: [
      'Face cards (J, Q, K) have no numeric value for combining; they can only pair.',
      'Aces = 1 (or 14 in Royal Cassino variant).',
      "A 'sweep' (clearing entire tableau) earns 1 bonus point. The sweeping card is turned face-up to track sweeps.",
      'All table cards not captured go to the last player who made any capture.',
    ],
